WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
A heavy truck and a small
car collide on an open road.

2
00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.980
The truck rolls on.

3
00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.800
The small car comes off far worse.

4
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.640
It looks as if the
truck simply hit harder.

5
00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:16.400
But during the crash itself,
which one feels the bigger force?

6
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.510
In this mission, you'll track
the forces between a book,

7
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.840
the table under it, and the Earth.

8
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:25.870
Then you'll untangle a
puzzle: a horse pulls a wagon,

9
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:30.450
the wagon pulls back on the horse,
yet the wagon still speeds up.

10
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.080
Your mission: explain which vehicle
feels the bigger force in the crash.
